### String Concatenation in Loops

```java
// ❌ Creates a new String object every iteration — O(n²) allocations
String result = "";
for (String s : list) {
    result += s + ", ";
}

// ✅ StringBuilder is O(n)
var sb = new StringBuilder();
for (String s : list) {
    sb.append(s).append(", ");
