// ✅ Or use String.join / Collectors.joining
String result = String.join(", ", list);
```

### Autoboxing Overhead

```java
// ❌ Unnecessary boxing in tight loops
Long sum = 0L;
for (long i = 0; i < 1_000_000; i++) {
    sum += i;  // unboxes sum, adds, boxes result each iteration
}

